/plan/PROGRESS.md
# Solids report: the primitives example's --json output, uploaded by CI from main
# (artifact solids-report, scripts/fetch-solids.sh); never committed
/reports/solids/
# Mutation-testing reports (scripts/mutants.sh); never committed
/reports/mutants/
